ta-start=\"319\" data-end=\"347\">Vean Enter Shopify theme</strong> – a high converting, cinematic storefront with 10+ 3D intro templates designed for fashion brands, ecom startups, and anyone looking to stand out</p><p data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"530\"><strong data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"522\">• What makes us different:</strong><br data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"525\">We go beyond templates. Our themes deliver a <strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"597\">premium user experience</strong>, inspired by the most viral brands. With 3D visuals, smooth interactions, and stunning design. Our themes are custom built and ready to plug and play.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></article><article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full\" dir=\"auto\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-4\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto py-5 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"1bd0b2d4-3b8e-4511-b9f4-1fb9599463c0\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\"><p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"836\"><strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"788\">• How affiliates can earn:</strong><br data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"791\">Earn <strong data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"818\">25%–35% commission</strong> per sale. That’s:</p><ul data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"978\"><li data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"883\"><p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"883\"><strong data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"856\">$62.50–$87.50</strong> for each $250 theme sale</p></li><li data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"978\"><p data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"978\"><strong data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"909\">Up to $210 per sale</strong> when you refer clients to our $600 Vean Enter full service package</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1046\">Top performing affiliates unlock bonus tiers and additional perks.</p><p data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1289\"><strong data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1072\">• How to promote us:</strong><br data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1075\">We supply everything: 3D renders, scroll stopping product videos, mobile showcases, caption templates, and posting strategies. Promote via TikTok, IG Reels, email - or even automate outreach with our ManyChat flow.</p><p data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1516\"><strong data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1315\">• Other information:</strong><br data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1318\">Track your performance in a custom affiliate dashboard. You’ll also get access to our complete guide with content ideas, suggested hashtags, VPN tips for international reach, and best times to post.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></div></div><div id=\"thread-bottom-container\" class=\"content-fade relative isolate z-10 w-full basis-auto has-data-has-thread-error:pt-2 has-data-has-thread-error:[box-shadow:var(--sharp-edge-bottom-shadow)] md:border-transparent md:pt-0 dark:border-white/20 md:dark:border-transparent flex flex-col\"><div id=\"thread-bottom\"><div class=\"text-base mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-c